    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……施設の老朽化により床が\n傷んでいると報告がありまして。",
            "enText": "We received a report of damaged floorboards\ndue to deteriorating infrastructure.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -6724343693309918856,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ふむ、では業者の手配と見積もりを頼む。\nブライアンは簡易な物で構わない、\n注意書きの立て札を作ってくれないか？",
            "enText": "Hm… Have a contractor stop by and give\nus an estimate to fix it. Brian, can you make\na sign to alert any passing students?\nSomething simple is fine.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -8092423671758910358,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……面倒だな。",
            "enText": "…Sounds like a pain.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 6854762325676299229,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "言っておくが、今度こそ手伝わんからな！\n貴様も少しは副会長の自覚を持て！",
            "enText": "Just so we're clear, you're not getting\nany help from me this time! You're a vice—\npresident too, so try to act like one!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -5524877982771848542,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "チッ……。",
            "enText": "Tch…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 2703068041942752021,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "はは。どうか頼むよ、ブライアン。\n私は現場の確認をして、\n傷み具合や範囲を纏めておこう。",
            "enText": "Haha, I'm looking forward to the sign, Brian.\nAs for me, I shall head over to inspect the area.\nWe need to know how bad the damage is.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4339638692072048966,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "先方はこちらが資料にて状況を伝えない限り、\n知りようがないからな……知りようが……お。",
            "enText": "In order to properly convey to the contractor\nthe degree of damage, we need more eyes on\nthe ground… Hm? Eyes on the… ground.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 2335437038359328697,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "あの、会長……？",
            "enText": "Um, President…?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -57102650515324643,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "ふふっ……資料がなければ、\n知りようがない……はははっ。",
            "enText": "Hehe… Eyes on the ground.\nGet it? It's the floor! Hahaha!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 6027132154301435621,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナリタブライアン",
            "enName": "Narita Brian",
            "jpText": "……ツボる所かよ。",
            "enText": "This isn't the time for jokes…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 5939850245400387146,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
